deps): update github.com/opentracing-contrib/go-grpc/test digest to 0261db7 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7278\\n\\n* Fix missing link in changelog by @MrAlias in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7273\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z tag v1 39 0 publish 2025 12 08t16 45 46z what s chang drop support for go 123 by mralia in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7274 fix dep updat modul go opentelemetri io collector pdata to v1 400 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7275 chore dep updat modul github com securego gosec v2 to v2 22 8 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7276 fix dep updat modul github com golangci golangci lint v2 to v2 40 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7277 fix dep updat golang org x by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7188 fix dep updat modul github com opentrac contrib go grpc to v0 12 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7281 fix dep updat googleapi to ef028d9 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7279 chore dep updat modul github com rogpepp go intern to v1 14 1 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7283 chore dep updat modul github com spf13 pflag to v1 0 9 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7282 fix dep updat github com opentrac contrib go grpc test digest to 0261db7 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7278 fix miss link in changelog by mralia in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7273\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"2b3636dadf7f2a2a\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.4380251090352192, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.29632225576459886, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7686651, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Add experimental observability metrics in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploghttp`. (#7512)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability metrics for manual reader in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`. (#7524)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability metrics for periodic reader in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`. (#7571)\\n\\n- Support `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_LOGS_INSECURE` and `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_INSECURE` environmental variables in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploghttp`. (#7608)\\n\\n- Add `Enabled` method to the `Processor` interface in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log`. All `Processor` implementations now include an `Enabled` method. (#7639)\\n\\n- The `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.38.0` package. The package contains semantic conventions from the `v1.38.0` version of the OpenTelemetry Semantic Conventions. See the [migration documentation](./semconv/v1.38.0/MIGRATION.md) for information on how to upgrade from `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.37.0.`(#7648)\\n\\n### Changed\\n\\n- `Distinct` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute` is no longer guaranteed to uniquely identify an attribute set. Collisions between `Distinct` values for different Sets are possible with extremely high cardinality (billions of series per instrument), but are highly unlikely. (#7175)\\n\\n- `WithInstrumentationAttributes` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace` synchronously de-duplicates the passed attributes instead of delegating it to the returned `TracerOption`. (#7266)\\n\\n- `WithInstrumentationAttributes` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/meter` synchronously de-duplicates the passed attributes instead of delegating it to the returned `MeterOption`. (#7266)\\n\\n- `WithInstrumentationAttributes` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/log` synchronously de-duplicates the passed attributes instead of delegating it to the returned `LoggerOption`. (#7266)\\n\\n- Rename the `OTEL_GO_X_SELF_OBSERVABILITY` environment variable to `OTEL_GO_X_OBSERVABILITY` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/trace`, `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log`, and `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/stdout/stdouttrace`. (#7302)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"add experiment observ metric in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploghttp 7512 add experiment observ metric for manual reader in go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric 7524 add experiment observ metric for period reader in go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric 7571 support otel _ export _ otlp _ log _ insecur and otel _ export _ otlp _ insecur environment variabl in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploghttp 7608 add enabl method to the processor interfac in go opentelemetri io otel sdk log all processor implement now includ an enabl method 7639 the go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 38 0 packag the packag contain semant convent from the v1 38 0 version of the opentelemetri semant convent see the migrat document semconv v1 38 0 migrat md for inform on how to upgrad from go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 37 0 7648 chang distinct in go opentelemetri io otel attribut is no longer guarante to uniqu identifi an attribut set collis between distinct valu for differ set are possibl with extrem high cardin billion of seri per instrument but are high unlik 7175 withinstrumentationattribut in go opentelemetri io otel trace synchron de duplic the pass attribut instead of deleg it to the return traceropt 7266 withinstrumentationattribut in go opentelemetri io otel meter synchron de duplic the pass attribut instead of deleg it to the return meteropt 7266 withinstrumentationattribut in go opentelemetri io otel log synchron de duplic the pass attribut instead of deleg it to the return loggeropt 7266 renam the otel _ go _ x _ self _ observ environ variabl to otel _ go _ x _ observ in go opentelemetri io otel sdk trace go opentelemetri io otel sdk log and go opentelemetri io otel export stdout stdouttrac 7302\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"6a08b40f9cb6a8a6\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.41483642569333157, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.25943609384761657, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7774372, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploggrpc`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploghttp`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetricgrpc`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlpmetric/otlpmetrichttp`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracegrpc`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Return partial OTLP export errors to the caller in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp`. (#7372)\\n\\n- Fix `AddAttributes`, `SetAttributes`, `SetBody` on `Record` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log` to not mutate input. (#7403)\\n\\n- Do not double record measurements of `RecordSet` methods in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.37.0`. (#7655)\\n\\n- Do not double record measurements of `RecordSet` methods in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.36.0`. (#7656)\\n\\n### Removed\\n\\n- Drop support for [Go 1.23]. (#7274)\\n\\n- Remove the `FilterProcessor` interface in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log`. The `Enabled` method has been added to the `Processor` interface instead. All `Processor` implementations must now implement the `Enabled` method. Custom processors that do not filter records can implement `Enabled` to return `true`. (#7639)\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-REL-01]\\n\\n# Release: v1.39.0 — Release v1.39.0/v0.61.0/v0.15.0/v0.0.14\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/releases/tag/v1.39.0  \\n\\n**Author**: MrAlias  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-12-08T16:32:32Z · **Updated**: 2025-12-08T16:45:46Z  \\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploggrpc 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploghttp 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlpmetr otlpmetricgrpc 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlpmetr otlpmetrichttp 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlptrac otlptracegrpc 7372 return partial otlp export error to the caller in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlptrac otlptracehttp 7372 fix addattribut setattribut setbodi on record in go opentelemetri io otel sdk log to not mutat input 7403 do not doubl record measur of recordset method in go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 37 0 7655 do not doubl record measur of recordset method in go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 360 7656 remov drop support for go 123 7274 remov the filterprocessor interfac in go opentelemetri io otel sdk log the enabl method ha been ad to the processor interfac instead all processor implement must now implement the enabl method custom processor that do not filter record can implement enabl to return true 7639 sourc id src rel 01 releas v1 39 0 releas v1 39 0 v0 61 0 v0 15 0 v0 0 14 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go releas tag v1 39 0 author mralia creat 2025 12 08t16 32 32z updat 2025 12 08t16 45 46z\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"2b3a16f34fc9921d\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.40884881106730386, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.24528527581043408, \"vector_similarity\": 0.79049706, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: [SRC-REL-01]\\n\\n# Release: v1.39.0 — Release v1.39.0/v0.61.0/v0.15.0/v0.0.14\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/releases/tag/v1.39.0  \\n\\n**Author**: MrAlias  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-12-08T16:32:32Z · **Updated**: 2025-12-08T16:45:46Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**Tag**: `v1.39.0`  \\n\\n**Published**: 2025-12-08T16:45:46Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Overview\\n\\n### Added\\n\\n- Greatly reduce the cost of recording metrics in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric` using hashing for map keys. (#7175)\\n\\n- Add `WithInstrumentationAttributeSet` option to `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/log`, `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/metric`, and `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace` packages. This provides a concurrent-safe and performant alternative to `WithInstrumentationAttributes` by accepting a pre-constructed `attribute.Set`. (#7287)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability for the Prometheus exporter in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/prometheus`. Check the `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/prometheus/internal/x` package documentation for more information. (#7345)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability metrics in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlplog/otlploggrpc`. (#7353)\\n\\n- Add temporality selector functions `DeltaTemporalitySelector`, `CumulativeTemporalitySelector`, `LowMemoryTemporalitySelector` to `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`. (#7434)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability metrics for simple log processor in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log`. (#7548)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability metrics in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracegrpc`. (#7459)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability metrics in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp`. (#7486)\\n\\n- Add experimental observability metrics for simple span processor in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/trace`. (#7374)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src rel 01 releas v1 39 0 releas v1 39 0 v0 61 0 v0 15 0 v0 0 14 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go releas tag v1 39 0 author mralia creat 2025 12 08t16 32 32z updat 2025 12 08t16 45 46z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z tag v1 39 0 publish 2025 12 08t16 45 46z overview ad great reduc the cost of record metric in go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric use hash for map key 7175 add withinstrumentationattributeset option to go opentelemetri io otel log go opentelemetri io otel metric and go opentelemetri io otel trace packag this provid a concurr safe and perform altern to withinstrumentationattribut by accept a pre construct attribut set 7287 add experiment observ for the prometheus export in go opentelemetri io otel export prometheus check the go opentelemetri io otel export prometheus intern x packag document for more inform 7345 add experiment observ metric in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlplog otlploggrpc 7353 add tempor selector function deltatemporalityselector cumulativetemporalityselector lowmemorytemporalityselector to go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric 7434 add experiment observ metric for simpl log processor in go opentelemetri io otel sdk log 7548 add experiment observ metric in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlptrac otlptracegrpc 7459 add experiment observ metric in go opentelemetri io otel export otlp otlptrac otlptracehttp 7486 add experiment observ metric for simpl span processor in go opentelemetri io otel sdk trace 7374\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"a1aa75b09f729579\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \