wd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.24528527581043408, \"vector_similarity\": 0.75184286, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"* Add a version const to otlptracehttp by @MrAlias in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7479\\n\\n* feat: Improve error handling in prometheus exporter by @tongoss in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7363\\n\\n* Add the `internal/observ` pkg to `otlptracehttp` by @MrAlias in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7480\\n\\n* Move sdk/internal/env to sdk/trace/internal/env by @dmathieu in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7437\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module github.com/gofrs/flock to v0.13.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7487\\n\\n* Instrument the `otlptracehttp` exporter by @MrAlias in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7486\\n\\n* chore(deps): update github/codeql-action action to v4.30.8 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7489\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module github.com/catenacyber/perfsprint to v0.10.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7496\\n\\n* OTLP trace exporter include W3C trace flags (bits 0–7) in Span.Flags  by @nikhilmantri0902 in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7438\\n\\n* Fix typos and linguistic errors in documentation / hacktoberfest by @survivant in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7494\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module github.com/kunwardeep/paralleltest to v1.0.15 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7501\\n\\n* RELEASING - Remove demo-accounting service from dependency list by @Kielek in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7503\\n\\n* Added the `internal/observ` package to otlploghttp by @yumosx in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7484\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"add a version const to otlptracehttp by mralia in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7479 feat improv error handl in prometheus export by tongoss in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7363 add the intern observ pkg to otlptracehttp by mralia in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7480 move sdk intern env to sdk trace intern env by dmathieu in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7437 chore dep updat modul github com gofr flock to v0 13 0 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7487 instrument the otlptracehttp export by mralia in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7486 chore dep updat github codeql action action to v4 30 8 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7489 chore dep updat modul github com catenacyb perfsprint to v0 100 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7496 otlp trace export includ w3c trace flag bit 0 7 in span flag by nikhilmantri0902 in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7438 fix typo and linguist error in document hacktoberfest by surviv in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7494 chore dep updat modul github com kunwardeep paralleltest to v1 0 15 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7501 releas remov demo account servic from depend list by kielek in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7503 ad the intern observ packag to otlploghttp by yumosx in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7484\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"a1f3d3cf578e73ff\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3971129850673038, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.24528527581043402, \"vector_similarity\": 0.75137764, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"*   David also mentioned ongoing work on exponential histograms and a simpler \\\"last value\\\" PR that shares code with the histogram one.\\n\\n*   Tyler expressed a strong desire to merge the histogram reservoir PR in the current milestone due to its significant performance improvement and encouraged attendees to review it.\\n\\n**6. Milestone Check-in and Release Goals**\\n\\n*   Tyler conducted a check-in on the v1.39.0 milestones for [Otel](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/milestone/74) and [Contrib](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/milestone/33).\\n\\n*   **Exposed Temporality Selector Function PR:** Tyler noted that a previous SIG meeting concluded this PR was API pollution and should be closed. He will draft a comment and close it today.\\n\\n*   **Simple Span Processor (Tracing):** This PR needs another round of reviews but is considered straightforward and should remain in the milestone.\\n\\n*   **OTLP Metric GRPC Exporter Metrics:** This PR has been open for a while and needs more iteration. It might be moved out of the current milestone if a release push occurs.\\n\\n*   **Metrics SDK Standard Out Metrics Exporter & Standard Log Exporter:** Both PRs lack follow-up from their original authors and significant work is still needed. They are candidates for being bumped from the milestone.\\n\\n*   **Overall Release Strategy:** Tyler proposed making a release before KubeCon (less than a month away) and urged everyone to prioritize reviews for the critical PRs to achieve this goal.\\n\\n**7. KubeCon Discussion**\\n\\n*   **David Ashpole** asked if there was anything specific to announce or discuss at KubeCon.\\n\\n*   **Robert Pająk** mentioned the extended attributes merge in specification and product as something he'd like to highlight, though it's not ready.\\n\\n*   **Tyler Yahn** expressed interest in showcasing the new observability features.\\n\\n*   David suggested working towards a stable release of the HTTP instrumentation in Contrib. Tyler agreed it was a good idea but noted the significant work involved due to existing \\\"cruft\\\" and potential needs for API restructuring.\\n\\n**8. Tyler's Side Project (OTLP Exporter Error Types)**\\n\\n*   Tyler shared that he's been working on introducing new, custom error types for OTLP exporters to provide clearer, more unified error messages. This involves distinguishing between HTTP/gRPC errors, partial errors, and warnings. He has a prototype integrated for Otel Trace gRPC. While not critical, it improves observability and user understanding of errors.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"david also mention ongo work on exponenti histogram and a simpler last valu pr that share code with the histogram one tyler express a strong desir to merg the histogram reservoir pr in the current mileston due to it signific perform improv and encourag attende to review it 6 mileston check in and releas goal tyler conduct a check in on the v1 39 0 mileston for otel http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go mileston 74 and contrib http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib mileston 33 expos tempor selector function pr tyler note that a previous sig meet conclud this pr wa api pollut and should be close he will draft a comment and close it today simpl span processor trace this pr need anoth round of review but is consid straightforward and should remain in the mileston otlp metric grpc export metric this pr ha been open for a while and need more iter it might be move out of the current mileston if a releas push occur metric sdk standard out metric export standard log export both pr lack follow up from their origin author and signific work is still need they are candid for be bump from the mileston overal releas strategi tyler propos make a releas befor kubecon less than a month away and urg everyon to priorit review for the critic pr to achiev this goal 7 kubecon discuss david ashpol ask if there wa anyth specif to announc or discus at kubecon robert paj ą k mention the extend attribut merg in specif and product a someth he d like to highlight though it s not readi tyler yahn express interest in showcas the new observ featur david suggest work toward a stabl releas of the http instrument in contrib tyler agre it wa a good idea but note the signific work involv due to exist cruft and potenti need for api restructur 8 tyler s side project otlp export error type tyler share that he s been work on introduc new custom error type for otlp export to provid clearer more unifi error messag this involv distinguish between http grpc error partial error and warn he ha a prototyp integr for otel trace grpc while not critic it improv observ and user understand of error\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11