{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"tl-v1","tool":"ragflow_retrieval","arguments":{"dataset_ids":["74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37"],"metadata_condition":{"logic":"and","conditions":[{"name":"path","comparison_operator":"is","value":"sources"}]},"page_size":10,"vector_similarity_weight":0.3,"similarity_threshold":0.2,"top_k":1024,"keyword":false,"question":"add otelconf package support release open telemetry Go Contrib"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"chunks\": [{\"content\": \"After discussing it at the 23-OCT SIG call, the decision is in the short term to include this in an `init` function in the otelconf package that will automatically configure the SDK components\\n\\n---\\n\\n**dashpole** — 2025-12-04T18:32:17Z\\n\\n> in the short term to include this in an init function in the otelconf package\\n\\nOut of curiosity, what is the long-term plan?\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-ISSUE-05]\\n\\n# Issue: otelconf: add support for OTEL_EXPERIMENTAL_CONFIG_FILE variable (open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib#8059)\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/8059  \\n\\n**Author**: codeboten  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-22T21:25:29Z · **Updated**: 2026-04-03T11:34:34Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**State**: closed (completed)  \\n\\n**Labels**: enhancement, area: file-config  \\n\\n**Milestone**: untracked\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Timeline\\n\\n- 2025-10-22T21:25:30Z · **labeled** by codeboten `enhancement`\\n\\n- 2025-10-22T21:25:42Z · **labeled** by github-actions[bot] `area: file-config`\\n\\n- 2025-10-22T21:27:48Z · **renamed** by codeboten \\\"[Feature]: add support for OTEL_EXPERIMENTAL_CONFIG_FILE variable\\\" → \\\"otelconf: add support for OTEL_EXPERIMENTAL_CONFIG_FILE variable\\\"\\n\\n- 2025-10-30T21:39:26Z · **referenced** by codeboten\\n\\n- 2025-10-30T21:40:31Z · **cross-referenced** by codeboten ← https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/pull/8106\\n\\n- 2025-11-03T09:30:28Z · **cross-referenced** by pellared ← https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648\\n\\n- 2025-11-24T19:47:10Z · **referenced** by codeboten\\n\\n- 2025-11-27T17:50:35Z · **referenced** by codeboten\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"after discuss it at the 23 oct sig call the decis is in the short term to includ this in an init function in the otelconf packag that will automat configur the sdk compon dashpol 2025 12 04t18 32 17z in the short term to includ this in an init function in the otelconf packag out of curios what is the long term plan sourc id src issu 05 issu otelconf add support for otel _ experiment _ config _ file variabl open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib 8059 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib issu 8059 author codeboten creat 2025 10 22t21 25 29z updat 2026 04 03t11 34 34z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state close complet label enhanc area file config mileston untrack timelin 2025 10 22t21 25 30z label by codeboten enhanc 2025 10 22t21 25 42z label by github action bot area file config 2025 10 22t21 27 48z renam by codeboten featur add support for otel _ experiment _ config _ file variabl otelconf add support for otel _ experiment _ config _ file variabl 2025 10 30t21 39 26z referenc by codeboten 2025 10 30t21 40 31z cross referenc by codeboten http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib pull 8106 2025 11 03t09 30 28z cross referenc by pellar http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 2025 11 24t19 47 10z referenc by codeboten 2025 11 27t17 50 35z referenc by codeboten\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"874bc7c88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/issues/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8059.md\", \"id\": \"d8242cafdf66d46e\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.34779526666804395, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.15151515238292, \"vector_similarity\": 0.8057822, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/issues/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8059.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"874bc7c88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/issues/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8059.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/issues/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8059.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 2849, \"chunk_count\": 3, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:14\", \"token_count\": 1120, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"    - Advantages:\\n\\n      - Avoids SDK import cycles and keeps experimental behavior isolated.\\n\\n      - Lets users opt in; easier to iterate and gather feedback before considering SDK-level integration.\\n\\n- Global vs. explicit provider setup:\\n\\n  - The otel global package has its own subtleties; supporting both code paths may be necessary.\\n\\n  - Global setup increases risk of cycles/complexity; explicit function in contrib is cleaner initially.\\n\\n- Tentative direction:\\n\\n  - Do not add SDK-level support in the short term.\\n\\n  - Prototype in contrib (otelconf); gather user feedback.\\n\\n  - Revisit SDK inclusion later if demand and design stabilize.\\n\\n### Auto-instrumentation considerations\\n\\n- Go auto-instrumentation would likely benefit from config-file-driven setup, but it can build on the contrib implementation once it exists.\\n\\n### SDK experimental features README gap\\n\\n- There is an “observability” feature in an internal X package that is not documented in the README; should be updated.\\n\\n### Metrics pipeline and exponential histogram status\\n\\n- David:\\n\\n  - Working on exponential histogram; close to resolving one remaining issue (race condition).\\n\\n  - Performance is faster but currently ~150 ns vs. a ~120 ns goal; investigating sources of overhead (likely computation).\\n\\n- Tyler:\\n\\n  - Still owes reviews on metrics pipeline optimization PRs.\\n\\n  - Discussed exemplar/histogram locking changes; some PRs shift lock scope; others use a hot/cold structure.\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-05]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-11-03\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3479626706  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-11-03T09:30:26Z · **Updated**: 2025-11-03T09:30:26Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-10-23\\n\\n**Attendees:**\\n\\n- Tyler Yahn\\n\\n- Alex Boten\\n\\n- David Ashpole (dashpole)\\n\\n## Action Items\\n\\n- Alex: Draft a proposal/PR in opentelemetry-go-contrib/otelconf to:\\n\\n  - Load and apply OTEL_EXPERIMENTAL_CONFIG_FILE via an explicit function that returns configured SDK providers.\\n\\n  - Optionally provide an init-based variant guarded by the env var for experimentation (clearly documented).\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"advantag avoid sdk import cycl and keep experiment behavior isol let user opt in easier to iter and gather feedback befor consid sdk level integr global v explicit provid setup the otel global packag ha it own subtleti support both code path may be necessari global setup increas risk of cycl complex explicit function in contrib is cleaner initi tentat direct do not add sdk level support in the short term prototyp in contrib otelconf gather user feedback revisit sdk inclus later if demand and design stabil auto instrument consider go auto instrument would like benefit from config file driven setup but it can build on the contrib implement onc it exist sdk experiment featur readm gap there is an observ featur in an intern x packag that is not document in the readm should be updat metric pipelin and exponenti histogram status david work on exponenti histogram close to resolv one remain issu race condit perform is faster but current 150 n v a 120 n goal investig sourc of overhead like comput tyler still owe review on metric pipelin optim pr discuss exemplar histogram lock chang some pr shift lock scope other use a hot cold structur sourc id src note 05 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2025 11 03 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3479626706 author pellar creat 2025 11 03t09 30 26z updat 2025 11 03t09 30 26z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 10 23 attende tyler yahn alex boten david ashpol dashpol action item alex draft a propos pr in opentelemetri go contrib otelconf to load and appli otel _ experiment _ config _ file via an explicit function that return configur sdk provid option provid an init base variant guard by the env var for experiment clear document\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"873abbfe8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479626706.md\", \"id\": \"1109a6ade747ca21\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.33644901696565066, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.1590909099509296, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7502846, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479626706.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"873abbfe8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479626706.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479626706.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 4412, \"chunk_count\": 3, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:29\", \"token_count\": 1155, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"* Document the ordering guarantees provided by the metrics SDK by @dashpole in 