al/observ` package to otlploghttp by @yumosx in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7484\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"add a version const to otlptracehttp by mralia in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7479 feat improv error handl in prometheus export by tongoss in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7363 add the intern observ pkg to otlptracehttp by mralia in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7480 move sdk intern env to sdk trace intern env by dmathieu in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7437 chore dep updat modul github com gofr flock to v0 13 0 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7487 instrument the otlptracehttp export by mralia in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7486 chore dep updat github codeql action action to v4 30 8 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7489 chore dep updat modul github com catenacyb perfsprint to v0 100 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7496 otlp trace export includ w3c trace flag bit 0 7 in span flag by nikhilmantri0902 in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7438 fix typo and linguist error in document hacktoberfest by surviv in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7494 chore dep updat modul github com kunwardeep paralleltest to v1 0 15 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7501 releas remov demo account servic from depend list by kielek in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7503 ad the intern observ packag to otlploghttp by yumosx in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7484\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"a1f3d3cf578e73ff\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.31437274718001024, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.11363636454287179, \"vector_similarity\": 0.78275764, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-07]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-11-26\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3581463689  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-11-26T14:02:28Z · **Updated**: 2025-11-26T16:36:01Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-11-20  \\n\\n## Attendees\\n\\n- Tyler Yahn  \\n\\n- Owen Williams  \\n\\n- Sam Xie\\n\\n- Alex Boten  \\n\\n- David Ashpole  \\n\\n- Bryan Boreham  \\n\\n- (Mentioned: Robert Pająk)\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-07]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-11-26\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3581463689  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-11-26T14:02:28Z · **Updated**: 2025-11-26T16:36:01Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-11-20  \\n\\n## Discussions\\n\\n### 1. Next Go release & OTelConf RC support\\n\\n- Release blocked on RC support module; PR needs reviews.\\n\\n- Requested changes from Alex do not need to be in the current PR.\\n\\n- Module is `0.x`; breaking changes acceptable later.\\n\\n- Avoid exposing public API known to be removed immediately.\\n\\n- Discussed handling experimental features:\\n\\n  - `WithExperimentalFeatures`-style flag likely unhelpful.\\n\\n  - Possible `x` submodule to clearly isolate experimental APIs.\\n\\n  - Aligns with OTel-wide push for opt-in experimental features.\\n\\n### 2. HTTP default client deprecation (OTel HTTP)\\n\\n- Work deprecating default HTTP client usage is in progress.\\n\\n- `POST`/`GET` helpers rely on `http.DefaultClient` and limit configurability.\\n\\n- Follow-up PRs exist; need review for inclusion in upcoming release.\\n\\n### 3. Observability work & non-blocking PRs\\n\\n- Several observability PRs (e.g., self-observability for OTel gRPC) are ongoing, not release-blocking.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src note 07 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2025 11 26 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3581463689 author pellar creat 2025 11 26t14 02 28z updat 2025 11 26t16 36 01z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 11 20 attende tyler yahn owen william sam xie alex boten david ashpol bryan boreham mention robert paj ą k sourc id src note 07 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2025 11 26 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3581463689 author pellar creat 2025 11 26t14 02 28z updat 2025 11 26t16 36 01z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 11 20 discuss 1 next go releas otelconf rc support releas block on rc support modul pr need review request chang from alex do not need to be in the current pr modul is 0 x break chang accept later avoid expos public api known to be remov immedi discuss handl experiment featur withexperimentalfeatur style flag like unhelp possibl x submodul to clear isol experiment api align with otel wide push for opt in experiment featur 2 http default client deprec otel http work deprec default http client usag is in progress post get helper reli on http defaultcli and limit configur follow