ps://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7404\\n\\n* fix(deps): update googleapis to 65f7160 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7460\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module go.opentelemetry.io/collector/featuregate to v1.43.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7461\\n\\n* fix(deps): update module google.golang.org/grpc to v1.76.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7463\\n\\n* fix(deps): update module go.opentelemetry.io/collector/pdata to v1.43.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7462\\n\\n* Use sync.Map and atomics to improve sum performance by @dashpole in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7427\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module github.com/stretchr/objx to v0.5.3 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7464\\n\\n* chore(deps): update module github.com/prometheus/common to v0.67.1 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7465\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"support custom error type semant by mralia in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7442 fix dep updat build tool to v0 28 1 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7455 chore dep updat modul github com go git go git v5 to v5 16 3 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7456 chore dep updat modul github com bombsimon wsl v5 to v5 3 0 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7457 sdk trace trace id high 64 bit test by mahendrabishnoi2 in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7212 add the intern observ packag to otlptracegrpc by mralia in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7404 fix dep updat googleapi to 65f7160 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7460 chore dep updat modul go opentelemetri io collector featureg to v1 43 0 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7461 fix dep updat modul googl golang org grpc to v1 76 0 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7463 fix dep updat modul go opentelemetri io collector pdata to v1 43 0 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7462 use sync map and atom to improv sum perform by dashpol in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7427 chore dep updat modul github com stretchr objx to v0 53 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7464 chore dep updat modul github com prometheus common to v0 67 1 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7465\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"843222abe76915f8\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3122552871800103, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.11363636454287179, \"vector_similarity\": 0.77569944, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-05]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-11-03\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3479626706  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-11-03T09:30:26Z · **Updated**: 2025-11-03T09:30:26Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-10-23\\n\\n**Attendees:**\\n\\n- Tyler Yahn\\n\\n- Alex Boten\\n\\n- David Ashpole (dashpole)\\n\\n## Transcript\\n\\n### PR status: JSON/YAML unmarshalling\\n\\n- A small change (error tag) was suggested and applied.\\n\\n- Build is running; plan is to merge once green.\\n\\n### Adding env var support for OTEL_EXPERIMENTAL_CONFIG_FILE\\n\\nReference: Adding env var support for OTEL_EXPERIMENTAL_CONFIG_FILE: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/8059\\n\\n- Goal:\\n\\n  - If the env var is present, load the indicated config file and configure the SDK automatically, minimizing user code.\\n\\n- Current ecosystem notes:\\n\\n  - PHP reports support; other languages vary (JS likely working on it; C++ explicitly not supporting).\\n\\n  - Go users are accustomed to programmatic setup; unclear if SDK-level support is necessary.\\n\\n- Go implementation options discussed:\\n\\n  - SDK experimental feature-flag approach:\\n\\n    - Use internal “x”/experimental packages to expose a feature gate for the env var.\\n\\n    - Check the env var during SDK setup (e.g., TracerProvider construction), and if enabled, configure from the file.\\n\\n    - Complications:\\n\\n      - Potential import cycles (e.g., if otelconf needs sdk and vice versa).\\n\\n      - Decision required on how to handle passed options vs. config file (ignore vs. merge).\\n\\n      - Requires similar work across trace, metrics, and logs modules.\\n\\n  - Contrib-first approach (preferred short term):\\n\\n    - Implement in opentelemetry-go-contrib/otelconf:\\n\\n      - Provide an explicit function to load from OTEL_EXPERIMENTAL_CONFIG_FILE and construct/return SDK providers.\\n\\n      - Optionally offer an init-based side effect that sets the global provider if the env var is set (not ideal, but acceptable during experimental phase to collect feedback).\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src note 05 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2025 11 03 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3479626706 author pellar creat 2025 11 03t09 30 26z updat 2025 11 03t09 30 26z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 10 23 attende tyler yahn alex boten david ashpol dashpol transcript pr status json yaml unmarshal a small chang error tag wa suggest and appli build is run plan is to merg onc green ad env var support for otel _ experiment _ config _ file refer ad env var support for otel _ experiment _ config _ file http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib issu 8059 goal if the env var is present load the indic config file and configur the sdk automat minim user code current ecosystem note php report support other languag vari j like work on it c explicit not support go user are accustom to programmat setup unclear if sdk level support is necessari go implement option discuss sdk experiment featur flag approach use intern x experiment packag to expos a featur gate for the env var check the env var dure sdk setup e g tracerprovid construct and if enabl configur from the file complic potenti import cycl e g if otelconf need sdk and vice versa decis requir on how to handl pass option v config file ignor v merg requir similar work across trace metric and log modul contrib first approach prefer short term implement in opentelemetri go contrib otelconf provid an explicit function to load from otel _ experiment _ config _ file and construct return sdk provid option offer an init base side effect that set the global provid if the env var is set not ideal but accept dure experiment phase to collect feedback\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"873abbfe8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479626706.md\", \"id\": \"1f