{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"I can’t substantiate that it shipped in a release from the assigned dataset.\n\nThe SIG agreed to merge the OTelConf RC-support PR as-is, pending normal review, and treated it as release-blocking. The related feature issue cross-references contrib PR #8106, but it is marked **untracked**—not tied to a release. The dataset does confirm a v1.39.0 release occurred, but does not connect that PR or OTelConf support to it. [SRC-NOTE-07](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3581463689) · [SRC-ISSUE-05](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/8059) · [SRC-REL-01](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/releases/tag/v1.39.0)"}}
